# BotOfTheSpecter - bot host crontab.
#
# Single entry point for all OAuth token refresh jobs (custom bot, Spotify,
# Discord, StreamElements) - see token_refresh_scheduler.py for the per-job
# intervals and scheduling logic. Runs every minute; the script itself is a
# fast no-op for any job that isn't due yet.
#
# Install (as the botofthespecter user):
#   crontab /home/botofthespecter/crontab
# Verify:
#   crontab -l

* * * * * /home/botofthespecter/venvs/stable/bin/python /home/botofthespecter/token_refresh_scheduler.py >> /home/botofthespecter/logs/token_refresh_scheduler_cron.log 2>&1
